      "quote": "Studies published since 2016 included if they had sepsis patients with a history of HF (or a subgroup of patients with HF) and in-hospital mortality data on the patients that did or did not meet the 30 × 3 goal.",
      "reason": "Population (sepsis patients with history of HF), outcome (in-hospital mortality data on 30×3 goal), and timeframe restriction are specified, but eligible study designs are not explicitly stated as eligibility criteria (retrospective/observational nature is only noted in Discussion), and setting/follow-up requirements are not fully specified."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "The language was limited to English. ... Studies published since 2016 included ...",
      "reason": "Language (English) and publication year (since 2016) restrictions are reported; publication status is not explicitly restricted (abstracts were apparently included), so report characteristics are only partially specified."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "3 others were excluded because no raw mortality data was provided",
      "reason": "The review reports exclusion for lack of raw mortality data but does not distinguish exclusion because outcomes were not measured from exclusion because outcome results were not reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "The OR and 95% CI for mortality among HF patients with sepsis who received <30 × 3 vs. 30 × 3 were calculated for each study.",
      "reason": "The synthesis groups (<30×3 vs 30×3 fluid resuscitation) are clearly specified and directly linked to the comparison defined in the hypothesis (text_5)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Duplicated records, studies with unrelated title/abstract, studies that focused on a period broader than 3 h from the diagnosis of sepsis, and studies without mortality breakdown for HF patients or without IRB approval were excluded.",
      "reason": "Notable restrictions (e.g., English-only, publication since 2016, 3-hour timeframe, IRB approval) are stated without rationales for these restrictions."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 82
